  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Page No.# 1/2 vs The State Of Assam on 18 December, 2025 Page No.# 1/2 Gahc010278332025 undefined The Gauhati High Court (High Court Of Assam, Nagaland, Mizoram And Arunachal Pradesh) Case No. : Ab/2964/2025 Fakrul Islam Mazumder And Anr S/O- Motahir Ali Mazumder, Resident Of Village Berenga Pt.Iii, P.S. - Silchar, District - Cachar, Assam, Pin788005. 2: Naheed Hussain Mazumder S/O-Talibur Rahman Mazumder Resident Of Village Berenga Pt.Iii P.S. - Silchar District - Cachar Assam Pin-788005 Versus The State Of Assam Rep. By The Pp, Assam Advocate for the Petitioner : Mr. N H Barbhuiya, Ms. S. Dey,Ms. N.A. Laskar,Mr A Malek,Mr F A Laskar Advocate for the Respondent : Pp, Assam, Before Honourable Mr. Justice Rajesh Mazumdar Order",
    "facts": "Page No.# 2/2 This application has been filed under section 482 of BNSS praying for granting pre-arrest bail to the accused petitioner in connection with Jirighat P.S Case No. 23/2025 u/s 303(2)/317(2)/318(1) of BNS, 2023 r/w section 59 of the Food Safety & Standards Act, 2006. The petitioners apprehend the arrest in connection with the aforesaid case since they have been given an impression that they have been named by the main accused/driver of the vehicle which was suspected to be carrying stolen betel nuts of Burmese origin. The learned counsel for the petitioners has submitted that the driver who was driving the vehicle has already been directed to be released on bail by the order dated 10.12.2025 passed by the Judicial Magistrate 1 st Class Lakhipur, Cachar and therefore, he prays that the petitioners may be allowed the privilege of pre-arrest bail and they would co-operate with the investigation.",
